---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy | Top Realtors Cypress TX"
  description="What this Cypress realtor guide collects (nothing you type) and how outbound links work."
  path="/privacy.html"
>
  <main id="main" class="wrap legal">
    <span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span>
    <h1>Read without signing up.</h1>
    <p>
      We have no accounts, contact forms, visitor reviews, analytics scripts or
      advertising trackers. We don’t collect or forward inquiries to anyone.
    </p>
    <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
    <p>
      Realtor and source links take you to other websites, which have their own
      privacy practices.
    </p>
    <h2>Technical requests</h2>
    <p>
      Your browser requests page files from our hosting provider, which may keep
      routine server logs under its own retention practices. We use system
      fonts, so your browser makes no third-party font requests here.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
